/docs/superpowers/
/docs/research/
/docs/submission/
/docs/design/
/docs/spikes.md
/scripts/spikes/

# design-tool context (impeccable)
/.impeccable/
/PRODUCT.md
/DESIGN.md

# acceptance-run logs (generated by tests/acceptance/run.ts)
/tests/acceptance/results/
